{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"459b5a4b12b2ca0929884c296e82479f990b5c49c76874f4a699afa4e3d9e703","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":62,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["唯上帝是拯救"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大衛的詩，交給樂長，照耶杜頓的做法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"我的心默默等候上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的救恩從祂而來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯有祂才是我的磐石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的拯救，我的堡壘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不致動搖。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就像一面搖搖欲墜的牆壁、行將倒塌的籬笆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要攻擊我、置我於死地到何時呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們千方百計把我從高位拉下。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們善於說謊，嘴上祝福，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心卻咒詛。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"我的心啊！要默默等候上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我的盼望從祂而來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯有祂才是我的磐石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的拯救，我的堡壘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不致動搖。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的拯救和榮耀都仰賴上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂是我的堅固磐石，是我的避難所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾百姓啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要時刻信靠上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向祂傾心吐意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂是我們的避難所。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"卑賤人不過是一絲氣息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尊貴人不過是一場幻影，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"放在天平上就浮起來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們總共比空氣還輕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要依靠敲詐勒索，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"別妄想靠偷盜發財，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使財富增多，也不要倚靠它。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝再三告訴我：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"權能屬於上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，你充滿慈愛。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必照各人的行為來施行賞罰。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/62.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/63.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/61.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}